                    "node": {
                        "text": "\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\uddec: where I went for a summer programme but accidentally signed up for a full-time personality upgrade.\n\nThe goal was truly academics (ig), however ended up staying for the chaos, a serious addiction to strawberry matchas and the friendships that felt like inside jokes were waiting to happen.\n\nFrom pretending to be studious to actually being iconic - it was a wild, wonderful blur of outfits, learning with living and somehow everything felt so effortless (even when it wasn\u2019t).\n\nNo big realizations, just moments that mattered. 10/10 would do it all again (minus the humidity).\n\n#singaporedump #solo #solotrip  #newcitynewcrew #explorepage #fyp"
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
